INPUTS (read-only)
====================================================================================================================
  CFG319 W5 points: 5;  CFG320 Lambda_HL_max = 9.8698103e+8 GeV, M_P = 2.435e+18 GeV;  c_2 grid 9 points
  window alpha_c [9.62405e-14, 3.2e-9];  footings (labels only) {'canonical': 9.3619e-11, 'alt': 1.1279e-10}

====================================================================================================================
OPTION B -- +1 constant M_*: lowest-order Horava-type UV operator (test-khronon limit)
====================================================================================================================
  B0 operators (frozen): O_A: Delta L = + alpha_c eps (D_m a^m)^2,  D.a = grad.a - a.a
                         O_K: Delta L = - c_2 eps h^{mn} d_m K d_n K,  h = g + u u
     eps = 1/(M_* r_g)^2 (one coefficient each, fixed by M_*): +1 constant.

====================================================================================================================
B1  flat-space dispersion of the khronon scalar (sympy, T = t + pi, Minkowski)
====================================================================================================================
  IR                  : EL symbol -2*k**2*(-alpha*omega**2 + k**2*lambda);  omega^2 = k**2*lambda/alpha
  O_A healthy (+)     : EL symbol 2*k**2*(alpha*epsilon_UV*k**2*omega**2 + alpha*omega**2 - k**2*lambda);  omega^2 = k**2*lambda/(alpha*(epsilon_UV*k**2 + 1))
  O_A wrong sign (-)  : EL symbol -2*k**2*(alpha*epsilon_UV*k**2*omega**2 - alpha*omega**2 + k**2*lambda);  omega^2 = -k**2*lambda/(alpha*(epsilon_UV*k**2 - 1))
  O_K healthy (-)     : EL symbol -2*k**2*(-alpha*omega**2 + epsilon_UV*k**4*lambda + k**2*lambda);  omega^2 = k**2*lambda*(epsilon_UV*k**2 + 1)/alpha
  O_K wrong sign (+)  : EL symbol 2*k**2*(alpha*omega**2 + epsilon_UV*k**4*lambda - k**2*lambda);  omega^2 = -k**2*lambda*(epsilon_UV*k**2 - 1)/alpha
  [PASS] K4a B1 the derived dispersions equal the closed forms: O_A omega^2 = c_S^2 k^2/(1 + eps k^2), O_K omega^2 = c_S^2 k^2 (1 + eps k^2), c_S^2 = c_2/alpha (test khronon)
         measured: O_A True, O_K True
  [PASS] B1 both arms healthy with the frozen signs (kinetic > 0, omega^2 > 0 for all k); the opposite signs fail (O_A ghost at k > 1/sqrt(eps), O_K gradient instability)
         measured: healthy A True, K True; wrong-sign A ghost True, wrong-sign K omega^2 < 0 True
         reading:  UV scaling: O_A omega -> c_S/sqrt(eps) (z = 0, the phase speed falls to zero); O_K z = 2 (speed grows)
  K4b induced metric of the leaf (from the embedding): h_ij = Matrix([[-epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), x)**2 + 1, -epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), x)*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), y), -epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), x)*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), z)], [-epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), x)*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), y), -epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), y)**2 + 1, -epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), y)*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), z)], [-epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), x)*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), z), -epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), y)*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), z), -epsilon**2*Derivative(pi_s(x, y, z), z)**2 + 1]])
  [PASS] K4b leaf-curvature (B-type) terms vanish at quadratic order on the test-khronon background: the leaf metric is delta_ij + O(eps^2), so R[h] = O(eps^2) and R^2, R_ij R^ij = O(eps^4)
         measured: O(eps) part of h_ij: Matrix([[0, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0]])

